# The device list always contains the configured device: if it is currently not present it is appended as a DISABLED item.
# Before any device has been announced that disabled item is the only entry; modified() on a device that is not present is a no-op (false).
unique_name :1.8
camera_load
set a device_id str gone
new a pipewire-camera-source
props a
get a device_id str
response 1 "(0, {})"
finish 2 fd
registry_global 50 PipeWire:Interface:Node 3 node.name=cam0 "node.description=Front Camera"
dump a
props a
modified a device_id
name a
